#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Labeler Subscriptions\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"labeler-subscriptions\">ラベラー登録</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Labeler services each have a service identity, meaning a DID document. This is the DID that appears in the label source (**`src`**) field.\n"
msgstr "ラベラーサービスはそれぞれサービスIDを持ち、DIDドキュメントを意味します。これはラベルのソース（**`src`**）フィールドに表示されるDIDです。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "To include labels from a given labeler, set the `atproto-accept-labelers` header on an XRPC request to a comma-separated list of the DIDs of the labelers you want to include, like so:\n"
msgstr "特定のラベラーからのラベルを含めるには、XRPCリクエストの`atproto-accept-labelers`ヘッダーを、含めたいラベラーのDIDのカンマ区切りリストに設定します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"curl -H \"atproto-accept-labelers: did:plc:vmt7o7y6titkqzzxav247zrn, did:plc:vmt7o7y6titkqzzxav247zrn\"\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"curl -H \"atproto-accept-labelers: did:plc:vmt7o7y6titkqzzxav247zrn, did:plc:vmt7o7y6titkqzzxav247zrn\"\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also add labelers using the TypeScript SDK:\n"
msgstr "TypeScript SDKを使用してラベラーを追加することもできます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```tsx\n"
"import { Client } from '@atproto/lex'\n"
msgstr ""
"```tsx\n"
"import { Client } from '@atproto/lex'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// Global app-level labelers\n"
"Client.configure({\n"
"  appLabelers: ['did:plc:labeler1', 'did:plc:labeler2'],\n"
"})\n"
msgstr ""
"// アプリレベルのグローバルなラベラー\n"
"Client.configure({\n"
"  appLabelers: ['did:plc:labeler1', 'did:plc:labeler2'],\n"
"})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// Client-specific labelers\n"
"const client = new Client(session, {\n"
"  labelers: ['did:plc:labeler3'],\n"
"})\n"
msgstr ""
"// Clientインスタンス固有のラベラー\n"
"const client = new Client(session, {\n"
"  labelers: ['did:plc:labeler3'],\n"
"})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// Add labelers dynamically\n"
"client.addLabelers(['did:plc:labeler4'])\n"
msgstr ""
"// ラベラーを動的に追加\n"
"client.addLabelers(['did:plc:labeler4'])\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// Replace all labelers\n"
"client.setLabelers(['did:plc:labeler5'])\n"
msgstr ""
"// すべてのラベラーを置き換える\n"
"client.setLabelers(['did:plc:labeler5'])\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// Clear labelers\n"
"client.clearLabelers()\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"// ラベラーをクリア\n"
"client.clearLabelers()\n"
" ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Use labels in your app\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"use-labelers-in-your-app\">アプリでラベルを使う</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Labels may be placed on accounts or records. Apps can interprets targets in different ways:\n"
msgstr "ラベルはアカウントやレコードに紐付けられます。アプリはターゲットを異なる方法で解釈できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- On an account: has account-wide effects\n"
"- On a profile: affects only the profile record (e.g. user avatar) and never hides any content, including the account in listings.\n"
"- On content: affects the content specifically (a post record, a list, a feed, etc.)\n"
msgstr ""
"- アカウントに対して：アカウント全体に影響があります。\n"
"- プロフィールに対して：プロフィールレコード（例：ユーザーアバター）にのみ影響し、一覧からアカウントを隠すことはありません。\n"
"- コンテンツに対して：コンテンツ毎に固有の影響があります（投稿レコード、リスト、フィードなど）。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Reporting\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"reporting\">報告</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "To send a report to a Labeler, use the `com.atproto.moderation.createReport` procedure. Users may send reports to any of their labelers.\n"
msgstr "ラベラーに報告を送信するには、`com.atproto.moderation.createReport`を使用します。ユーザーはどのラベラーにでも報告を送信できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:56
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "To specify which labeler should receive the label, set the `atproto-proxy` header with the DID of the labeler and the service key of `atproto_labeler`. In the TypeScript SDK, it looks like this:\n"
msgid "To specify which labeler should receive the report, set the `atproto-proxy` header with the DID of the labeler and the service key of `atproto_labeler`. In the TypeScript SDK, it looks like this:\n"
msgstr "どのラベラーがラベルを受け取るべきかを指定するには、ラベラーのDIDと`atproto_labeler`サービスキーを`atproto-proxy`ヘッダーを設定します。TypeScript SDKでは、次のようになります。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { AtpAgent } from '@atproto/api'\n"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { AtpAgent } from '@atproto/api'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const agent = new AtpAgent({\n"
"    service: 'https://bsky.social'\n"
"})\n"
"await agent.login({\n"
"    identifier: 'alex.bsky.team',\n"
"    password: 'your-app-password'\n"
"})\n"
msgstr ""
"const agent = new AtpAgent({\n"
"    service: 'https://bsky.social'\n"
"})\n"
"await agent.login({\n"
"    identifier: 'alex.bsky.team',\n"
"    password: 'your-app-password'\n"
"})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/subscriptions/en.mdx:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"agent\n"
"  .withProxy('atproto_labeler', 'did:web:my-labeler.com')\n"
"  .createModerationReport({\n"
"    reasonType: 'com.atproto.moderation.defs#reasonViolation',\n"
"    reason: 'They were being such a jerk to me!',\n"
"    subject: { did: 'did:web:bob.com' },\n"
"  })\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"agent\n"
"  .withProxy('atproto_labeler', 'did:web:my-labeler.com')\n"
"  .createModerationReport({\n"
"    reasonType: 'com.atproto.moderation.defs#reasonViolation',\n"
"    reason: 'They were being such a jerk to me!',\n"
"    subject: { did: 'did:web:bob.com' },\n"
"  })\n"
"```\n"

